skilletor: source "shared" in the user config (${HOME}/.claude/skilletor.json) gives its only "git", "url" or "local", and the entries in the project config (${PROJECT}/.claude/skilletor.json) and ${PROJECT}/.claude/skilletor.local.json have none: config load would refuse those entries once this one is gone. Remove those entries first (skilletor source remove shared --project; edit ${PROJECT}/.claude/skilletor.local.json by hand), or give one of them a "git", "url" or "local" of its own; nothing was changed.
